      "writtenOn": "2023-02-08T14:17:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well, I had imagined that \"higher up\" could be in DrawPass::Make or something, but of course at that point we\u0027re only recording and don\u0027t have a replay translation. Also, I said viewport but I guess what I meant was the size of the render target. Maybe remembering the size of the colorTexture in CommandBuffer::onAddRenderPass and then intersecting translated scissors with that is ok? And if there\u0027s no intersection we can just set an empty scissor.",
      "parentUuid": "f5983c2c_ac84cf7e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 467,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 472,
        "endChar": 38
