      "writtenOn": "2023-02-08T15:55:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, I\u0027d seen DrawPass::bounds() before, but it doesn\u0027t seem to be set anywhere, so I think it\u0027s always empty?\n\nAnyways, here\u0027s a pass at tracking the render pass size (in the CommandBuffer base class, assuming any derived class using fReplayTranslation will also need it). MtlCommandBuffer also tracks whether the latest viewport \u0026 scissor intersected with the render pass bounds, and skips draw commands if not.",
      "parentUuid": "9d84e99a_bc331ba2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 467,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 472,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "4dc9e2d0f82ebefc430404a9c065989b4ef7d737",
